        "comments": "The assembly idAnoBell6 is based on 31x PacBio HiFi data and Arima Hi-C data generated by the Sanger Tree of Life Programme. The assembly process included the following sequence of steps: initial PacBio assembly generation with hifiasm, retained haplotig separation with purge_dups, and Hi-C based scaffolding with YAHS. The mitochondrial genome was assembled using MitoHifi. Finally, the assembly was analysed and manually improved using gEVAL. Chromosome-scale scaffolds confirmed by the Hi-C data have been named, ordered and oriented based on published data.",
